Subject: [PATCH] feat(android): harden local backup and restore

- Recover interrupted restores on startup before repository reads JSON
- Referential integrity validation for items/wear/wash/ootd/outfit
- parseFile rejects JSON null (no longer coerced to empty list)
- ZIP per-entry byte limit during copy and duplicate-entry rejection
- Delete old snapshot only after successful reload and health check
- validateDataDirectory for staging and post-swap health checks
- CSV UTF-8 BOM for Excel; zip MIME for restore picker
- Best-effort delete of failed export documents
- Fix pre-existing API 26 lint error for navigation bar (move to values-v27)
- Remove temporary patch files from repo; update README
